From: "Claude Agent (for Kai)" <claude-agent@anthropic.local>
Date: Wed, 8 Apr 2026 03:56:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] scaffold: initial framework shell from design memo v0.5

Lay out the nine-layer architecture described in the pre-implementation
design memo:

- src/ layer packages (watcher, ingestion, extraction, validation,
  adapters, workbook, protocol, cli) with placeholder modules and
  layer-contract docstrings pointing at SYSTEM_DESIGN.md
- tests/ skeleton (schema, golden, unit, integration) plus a smoke test
- docs/SYSTEM_DESIGN.md living system design document
- docs/neocloud_capex_tracker_design_memo.pdf full pre-implementation memo
- .github/workflows/ci.yml lint + test skeleton
- .github/workflows/watcher.yml scheduled watcher placeholder with
  single-writer concurrency group on workbook-write
- .gitignore (Python, Excel lock files, env, editors)
- pyproject.toml with dev/extraction/workbook/ingestion optional deps
- scripts/bootstrap.sh for local venv setup
- README.md rewritten with project summary and repo layout
- data/ and workbook/ placeholders

No runtime logic yet. All entrypoints raise NotImplementedError by design
pending the deferred design sessions (target companies, source_data schema,
Excel template layout, golden dataset scope, collaboration protocol).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
